Committee begins its threeday meeting. While Q2 GDP growth was arobust 8.2%, experts continue tolean towards afirst repo rate cut in6monthsamidrecord low inflation.

Murmu begins a two-day visit to Kerala where she willlead the Navy Day celebrations and witness Indian Navy's operational demonstration at Thiruvananthapuram.

@GERMANPRESIDENT Frank-Walter Steinmeier arrives in the UK ona threeday State visit, the first bya German leaderin nearly three decades. His visit includes a tripto Coventry Cathedral, which was bombed by Germany during WWII.
